B.a9u=new A.aM("Seizure Compass is a clinical decision-support aid that estimates the relative probability of an epileptic seizure, PNES, syncope or another paroxysmal mimic from witnessed clinical features, and suggests a probable lobe of onset when a focal epileptic mechanism is likely. It is a teaching and clinical-reasoning aid, not a diagnostic device.",null,B.nw,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
