B.Gv=new A.cr("Epilepsy vs PNES","Post-ictal prolactin","A rise in serum prolactin drawn 10-20 minutes after the event supports a generalized tonic-clonic or focal impaired awareness seizure over PNES; a normal level does not exclude an epileptic seizure (AAN 2005).",B.cn)
